    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting the weight settle\"... that's just a poetic way of saying there's nothing left. it feels like i'm just waiting for the end of a story that's already finished. if there's no meaning in staying, and no truth in the world around me, then what is the difference between just sitting here and just... letting go completely? isn't \"not forcing the pieces together\" just a slow way of admitting it's over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
